#, no-wrap
msgid "Tutorials for official Qiskit Addons — circuit cutting, sample-based quantum diagonalization, operator backpropagation, and more."
msgstr "Mga tutorial para sa mga opisyal na Qiskit Addons — circuit cutting, sample-based quantum diagonalization, operator backpropagation, at iba pa."

