#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and techniques. Each addon focuses on a specific area and includes tutorials with executable code.\n"
msgstr "Ang [Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) ay mga opisyal na extension package na nagbibigay ng mga espesyalisadong quantum computing algorithm at teknik. Bawat addon ay nakatuon sa isang partikular na area at may kasamang mga tutorial na may executable code.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available Addons {#available-addons}"
msgstr "Mga Available na Addon {#available-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width and depth by cutting gates and wires |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization for ground state estimation |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation to reduce circuit depth |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas for improved Hamiltonian simulation |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation with tensor networks |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption for error mitigation |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones for reducing PEC sampling overhead |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Package | Paglalarawan |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Bawasan ang circuit width at depth sa pamamagitan ng pagputol ng mga gate at wire |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization para sa pagtatantiya ng ground state |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation para bawasan ang circuit depth |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas para sa pinahusay na Hamiltonian simulation |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation gamit ang tensor network |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption para sa error mitigation |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones para sa pagbawas ng PEC sampling overhead |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All tutorials can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr "Lahat ng tutorial ay maaaring direktang isagawa sa iyong browser gamit ang Binder, o sa sarili mong Jupyter server.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For API documentation, visit the individual addon repos on [GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon).\n"
msgstr "Para sa API documentation, bisitahin ang mga indibidwal na addon repo sa [GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon).\n"
